   "text": "Constructor University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nConstructor University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nConstructor University (previously called Jacobs University and International University Bremen) is an international, private, residential research university located in Vegesack, Bremen, Germany. It offers study programs in engineering, humanities, natural and social sciences, in which students can acquire bachelor's, master's or doctorate degrees. Most of the instruction at the university is in English. Constructor University’s students come from more than 110 countries, with about 80% foreign students and approximately 33% international faculty members.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n02/04/2026 11:55\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n02/04/2026 11:55\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nGermany\nYearly Fees\nMax: €20,000.00\nMin: €3,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n80%\n1,440 of 1,800 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1999\nCampus(es)\nBremen\nCountry\nGermany\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/01/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://constructor.university/student-life/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://constructor.university/admission-aid/external-financing-options\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AaddRw7AEe4\nInternship Details\nhttps://constructor.university/student-life/career-services/career-services-for-companies\nAdditional Information\n-",
